			dependencies: ["0917C06AA703535A"]
			description: [
				"&7The &6Forge Rocket Nose Cone&r serves as the crowning piece of the &6Forge Rocket&r, representing the many challenges conquered throughout your journey.&r"
				""
				"Forged from powerful boss trophies and advanced aerospace components, the Nose Cone symbolizes the knowledge, experience, and determination required to reach the end of your adventure."
				""
				"Every battle fought and every world explored has contributed to its construction."
				""
