			dependencies: ["47C19D9E0F6234DB"]
			description: [
				"&7The &6Forge Rocket Door&r serves as the primary access point to the &6Forge Rocket&r and symbolizes the many worlds you have explored throughout your journey.&r"
				""
				"Unlike many other Forge Rocket components, the door is crafted using stone and structural materials gathered from numerous dimensions and planets. Each material represents a milestone in your adventure, from the Overworld to the farthest reaches of the cosmos."
