			description: [
				"&7The &6Forge Rocket Core&r is the heart of the &6Forge Rocket&r, bringing together the countless mechanical systems required to power humanity's greatest achievement.&r"
				""
				"Unlike structural components that rely on raw materials, the Core focuses on advanced engineering and automation. Its construction requires a wide variety of mechanisms produced throughout your journey, representing the machines, technologies, and production chains you have mastered."
